  "metadata": {
    "name": "Demo: Trance Arp",
    "author": "SonicRack",
    "description": "Classic trance arpeggio. Clocked step sequencer drives a saw VCO with plucky ADSR, resonant filter, dotted-eighth delay, air reverb, then stereo auto-pan (FX stay mono for realtime performance).",
